      "sourceId": "soldier_0_anby-core",
      "label": "Voltage Surge (Additional Ability)",
      "description": "When another character in your squad is a Stun or Support character:\n\nSoldier 0 - Anby's CRIT Rate increases by 10%. When Soldier 0 - Anby is the active character, all squad members' Aftershock DMG to enemies with a Silver Star mark increases by 25%.",
