      "description": "When another character in your squad is a Stun or Support character: Soldier 0 - Anby's CRIT Rate increases by 10%. When Soldier 0 - Anby is the active character, all squad members' Aftershock DMG to enemies with a Silver Star mark increases by 25%.",
